# The SQLite stores stay out of git — they are binary, they merge badly, and run-history and
# document-log carry execution data that has no business in source control.
#
# The Object Library is the exception that has to travel: a clone with no controls cannot run a
# single Test. `taf objects export` writes it as reviewable JSON, and that IS committed.
!object-library.json
